From 0a06cc451babb35d96781d46cb0a55e1da7da8c1 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 08:58:03 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(machine): expose pure limit checks in post

Move the report and world-free limit checks into camcraft-post.
Keep the ECS walk and document-specific checks in app.
Preserve the existing app diagnostic text and order.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <codex@openai.com>

Fixes #2585
